            <div xml:id="d189">

                <pb facs="0423" n="299" xml:id="pg299"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.73/35: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Piles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-07-16T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1923—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 18—10 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>17. Your May 5, 6 p.m. I am informed by Foreign Office that the Minister of
                    Government considers waiver of All America Cables is already accepted by
                    resolution of March 3rd, 1923 [<hi rendition="#italic">1922</hi>].</p>
                <p>Full report by mail.<anchor n="97" xml:id="d189-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Piles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
